---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base
  title="About — India Tech Collective"
  description="Why the India Tech Collective keeps open tools and public records together."
  path="/about/"
>
  <article class="about wrap">
    <header>
      <p class="file-label">About / statement of purpose</p>
      <h1>Tech unites for India.</h1>
      <p class="lede">Open tools. Public records. One standard for every party.</p>
    </header>

    <section class="oath">
      <p>We hold that self-rule begins with self-information.</p>
      <p>That what public servants declare on oath belongs to the public.</p>
      <p>That an accusation is not guilt, and guilt is for courts alone.</p>
      <p>That where the record is incomplete, the gap must be stated, not filled.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="about-grid">
      <div>
        <p class="file-label">Posture</p>
        <h2>Document, do not affiliate.</h2>
        <p>
          The Collective is not a political party, an opposition outlet, or a
          prosecutor. It takes a position on whether the governed are entitled to
          the public record.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="file-label">Method</p>
        <h2>Source, date, denominator.</h2>
        <p>
          Public figures are attached to their sources and limits. Corrections
          remain visible. Named records carry a standing right of reply.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="file-label">Privacy</p>
        <h2>No surveillance required.</h2>
        <p>
          The site has no advertising trackers. Contributor identities may be
          pseudonymous where disclosure would create risk.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <blockquote>
      “All citizens shall have the right to freedom of speech and expression.”
      <cite>Constitution of India · Article 19(1)(a)</cite>
    </blockquote>
  </article>
</Base>

<style>
  .about { padding-block: clamp(4rem, 10vw, 9rem); }
  .about h1 { margin-top: 1rem; font-size: clamp(3.5rem, 9vw, 7rem); letter-spacing: -0.05em; line-height: 0.86; max-width: 8ch; }
  .about .lede { margin-top: 1.4rem; }
  .oath { margin: clamp(4rem, 9vw, 8rem) 0; padding: 2rem 0 2rem 2rem; border-left: 3px solid var(--seal-red); font-size: clamp(1.35rem, 2.6vw, 2rem); line-height: 1.35; }
  .oath p + p { margin-top: 0.9rem; }
  .about-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 2rem; }
  .about-grid h2 { margin-top: 0.8rem; font-size: 1.6rem; }
  .about-grid div > p:last-child { margin-top: 0.8rem; color: var(--muted); }
  blockquote { margin-top: 6rem; padding-top: 2rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--line-strong); font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 4vw, 3.2rem); line-height: 1.1; }
  cite { display: block; margin-top: 1rem; font-family: var(--mono); font-size: 0.65rem; font-style: normal; letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted); }
  @media (max-width: 760px) { .about-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
</style>
